{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1997","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Level Up"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Monocarp is playing a computer game. He starts the game being level $$$1$$$. He is about to fight $$$n$$$ monsters, in order from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$. The level of the $$$i$$$-th monster is $$$a_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each monster in the given order, Monocarp's encounter goes as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if Monocarp's level is strictly higher than the monster's level, the monster flees (runs away); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise, Monocarp fights the monster. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After every $$$k$$$-th fight with a monster ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fleeing monsters do not count"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), Monocarp's level increases by $$$1$$$. So, his level becomes $$$2$$$ after $$$k$$$ monsters he fights, $$$3$$$ after $$$2k$$$ monsters, $$$4$$$ after $$$3k$$$ monsters, and so on."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to process $$$q$$$ queries of the following form:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$i~x$$$: will Monocarp fight the $$$i$$$-th monster (or will this monster flee) if the parameter $$$k$$$ is equal to $$$x$$$? "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, q \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of monsters and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the levels of the monsters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the $$$j$$$-th of the following $$$q$$$ lines, two integers $$$i$$$ and $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\le i, x \\le n$$$) — the index of the monster and the number of fights required for a level up in the $$$j$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", if Monocarp will fight the $$$i$$$-th monster in this query, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", if the $$$i$$$-th monster flees."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 16\n2 1 2 1\n1 1\n2 1\n3 1\n4 1\n1 2\n2 2\n3 2\n4 2\n1 3\n2 3\n3 3\n4 3\n1 4\n2 4\n3 4\n4 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 15\n1 1 2 1 1 1 1\n5 3\n2 2\n2 2\n1 6\n5 1\n5 5\n7 7\n3 5\n7 4\n4 3\n2 5\n1 2\n5 6\n4 1\n6 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1997E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1997/problem/E"}